sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant O as Owner
    participant A as Attacker<br/>(reads the traffic)
    participant E as Empty replica<br/>(just restarted)
    participant H as Other replicas
    O->>H: STORE(position 1)
    rect rgba(192, 57, 43, 0.07)
    Note over A,E: a forged record
    A-->>A: sees it, signs a forged position 2 with the DID,<br/>the genesis and the path it read, and a key of its own
    A->>E: STORE(forged 2)
    Note over E: its key and code do not reach the root at 2
    E-->>A: InvalidRecord, nobody asked, nothing stored
    end
    rect rgba(201, 138, 27, 0.09)
    Note over A,H: a genuine record replayed
    A->>E: STORE(genuine position 0, read on the wire earlier)
    Note over E: in form and signed by key 0,<br/>but maybe superseded
    E->>H: FindHash(key)
    H-->>E: position 1 and the hash of record 1
    E->>H: FindValue(key) to the closest that claimed 1
    H-->>E: record 1: in the tree at 1, signature verifies
    Note over E: stores record 1
    E-->>A: Stale
    end
